  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VsNs9xP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F411xGo.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Haubna\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EOPNsK1.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftphysicsmod.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6iCc4ux.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h1><strong>新版本僅在官方網站提供</strong></h1><p>⠀</p><h3><strong>全新的沉浸式體驗</strong></h3><p>進入一個前所未見的新世界。崩塌的洞穴、互動式布娃娃物理、物品物理等更多精彩內容等你來探索！\n⠀\n⠀</p><h3><strong>支援平台</strong></h3><p>Windows、Linux 和 MacOS（M1/M2 CPU 僅能與 Minecraft 1.20 及以上版本相容，其他版本需使用相容模式：<a href=\"https://github.com/haubna/PhysicsMod/issues/461#issuecomment-1332775496\" rel=\"nofollow\">教學</a>）！\n⠀\n⠀</p><h3><strong>生物</strong></h3><p>每個物理狂熱者的最愛部分。每種原版 Minecraft 生物都支援布娃娃物理、碎裂效果和方塊化版本！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/637/310/172/mob_ragdolls.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/638/310/172/mob_blocky.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/639/310/172/mob_fracturing.png\" alt=\"\">\n⠀\n⠀</p><h3><strong>方塊</strong></h3><p>讓 Minecraft 世界中的方塊碎裂成碎片！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/640/310/172/block_fractured.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/641/310/172/block_particles.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/649/93/310/172/block_voxels.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/642/310/172/block_blocky.png\" alt=\"\">\n⠀\n⠀</p><h3><strong>其他功能</strong></h3><p>厭倦了漂浮的物品嗎？試試物品物理吧！重力？月球？火星？冥王星？地球？隨你調整！想讓你的電腦性能達到極限嗎？試試崩塌結構，看看它能撐多久！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/643/310/172/custom_gravity.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/644/310/172/item_physics.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/543/645/310/172/collapsing_structures.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
